@startuml
title Activity 26 - Supplier Tax and Payment Settings

|Supplier|
start
:Open Supplier Settings;
:Choose Tax Information or Payment Details;
:Enter tax number, bank name, account name and account number;
|Frontend|
:Validate required and sensitive fields;
if (Values valid?) then (yes)
  :POST supplier-tax or supplier-finance settings;
  |Backend|
  :Authenticate supplier;
  :Verify supplier ownership;
  if (Authorized?) then (yes)
    :Persist protected settings;
    :Write update history;
    |Frontend|
    :Show update confirmation;
    stop
  else (no)
    :Return 403;
    |Frontend|
    :Show access error;
    stop
  endif
else (no)
  :Show validation errors;
  stop
endif
@enduml
